                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14596618" author="rajnish" created="Mon, 22 Jun 2015 20:49:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Is there any workaround, I can do. It is blocking me now.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14597799" author="dean1.wood" created="Tue, 23 Jun 2015 15:17:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Same problem using spark 1.3.1&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is potentially killing a large project using zeppelin.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14598145" author="moon" created="Tue, 23 Jun 2015 18:37:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi, Thanks for creating an issue.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve just tried with spark-1.3.1-hadoop2.3 cluster, and it works fine.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;sc.hadoopConfiguration.set(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;fs.s3n.awsAccessKeyId&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;...&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
sc.hadoopConfiguration.set(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;fs.s3n.awsSecretAccessKey&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;...&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
val file = &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;s3n:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//support.elasticmapreduce/bigdatademo/sample/wiki&quot;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;val data = sc.textFile(file)
data.first
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, workaround could be using hadoop 2.x.&lt;br/&gt;
If you need hadoop 1 support, I&apos;m working on it &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/111&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/111&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14598583" author="moon" created="Tue, 23 Jun 2015 23:43:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I pushed more commits and now &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/111&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/111&lt;/a&gt; fixes the problem accessing S3 with hadoop-1. Let me know if it helps.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
